>Jugurtha</a> takes <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cirta">Cirta</a> and kills <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/adherbal">Adherbal</a> and Italian traders</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">105 BCE</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bocchus-i">Bocchus I</a> hands <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jugurtha">Jugurtha</a> over to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sulla">Sulla</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">46 BCE</span><span class="rf-text">Caesar defeats <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/juba-i">Juba I</a> at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-thapsus">Thapsus</a> and creates the province of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/africa-nova">Africa Nova</a></span></li></ol>
